# StudentStay Colombo - environment variables
#
# Stage 1 does not use Supabase yet, so this file is currently empty
# of real values. It is included now so the project structure is
# ready for later stages.
#
# From Stage 4 onward, you will add values such as:
# SUPABASE_URL=your-project-url
# SUPABASE_KEY=your-anon-or-service-key
#
# Never commit your real .env file to GitHub.
# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in real values when Supabase is introduced.
